"table":"table-0"},"269":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-28","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#panel-message","content":"| Label       | Meaning                         |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Image URL` | Large image on the panel embed. |","table":"table-0"},"270":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-29","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#panel-message","content":"| Label           | Meaning                                   |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `Thumbnail URL` | Small image top-right of the panel embed. |","table":"table-0"},"271":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-30","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#panel-message","content":"The **Colour (decimal)** field on the panel is a plain integer such as `9133302` (that's\n`#8B5CF6`, the brand purple). The customization card's colour fields use `#hex` instead - both\nwork, they belong to different controls."},"272":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-31","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#dropdown-vs-buttons","content":"**Dropdown** - one select menu. Up to **25** ticket types. Best when you have several options."},"273":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-32","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#dropdown-vs-buttons","content":"**Buttons** - one button per type. Discord allows **5** buttons per row, so the panel shows at\nmost **5** types in this mode."},"274":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-33","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#preview","content":"A live mock of the panel title, description and a chip per ticket type. It updates as you type.\nUse it to sanity-check wording and colours before saving."},"275":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-34","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#ticket-types","content":"Click **+ Add type**. Each type is a block and becomes one option on the panel."},"276":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-35","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#ticket-types","content":"Top row:"},"277":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-36","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#ticket-types","content":"Emoji box (placeholder `🎫`)"},"278":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-37","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#ticket-types","content":"Label box (placeholder `Label`)"},"279":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-38","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#ticket-types","content":"A **remove** button"},"280":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-39","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"Expand this section per type to override the server defaults for that type only:"},"281":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-40","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                                                               |\n| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Description` | Shown under the label in the dropdown and in the panel's option list. |","table":"table-1"},"282":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-41","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field      | Meaning                            |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Category` | Category for tickets of this type. |","table":"table-1"},"283":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-42","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                                     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `Staff roles` | Roles that can manage tickets of this type. |","table":"table-1"},"284":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-43","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field         | Meaning                          |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `Admin roles` | Higher-tier roles for this type. |","table":"table-1"},"285":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-44","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                            | Meaning                                           |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Naming scheme (blank = server)` | Overrides the server naming scheme for this type. |","table":"table-1"},"286":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-45","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field              | Meaning                                    |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `Default priority` | `-- inherit --` or one of your priorities. |","table":"table-1"},"287":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-46","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                             | Meaning                            |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Max open per user for this type` | `(none)` - cap this type per user. |","table":"table-1"},"288":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-47","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                                       | Meaning                                     |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `Max open overall (blank = server setting)` | `(server)` - cap all tickets for this type. |","table":"table-1"},"289":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-48","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                    | Meaning                            |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `Welcome title override` | Overrides the welcome embed title. |","table":"table-1"},"290":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-49","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                           | Meaning                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `Welcome colour override (hex)` | Overrides the welcome embed colour. |","table":"table-1"},"291":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-50","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                      | Meaning                              |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Welcome message override` | Overrides the welcome embed message. |","table":"table-1"},"292":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-51","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#advanced-roles-limits-welcome-override","content":"| Field                                                                | Meaning    |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| `Sub-types (one per line: emoji label \\| description; blank = none)` | See below. |","table":"table-1"},"293":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-52","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#sub-types","content":"A sub-type is a second choice under a ticket type - e.g. type `Bug report` with sub-types\n`🐛 Crash | The app closes` and `🐌 Slow | It's laggy`."},"294":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-53","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#sub-types","content":"Format each line as:"},"295":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-54","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#sub-types","content":"Blank lines and lines without a label are ignored, and up to 25 are offered. When a user picks a\ntype that has sub-types, Discord shows a **second menu** so they choose the sub-type before the\nticket opens. The sub-type label is stored on the ticket as its subject."},"296":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-55","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#message--colour-customization-per-panel","content":"The same fields as the server-wide card, but these values **override the server defaults for this\npanel only**. Intro line: `Panel overrides for ticket messages. Values shown merge your server\ndefaults with this panel's own overrides.`"},"297":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-56","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#message--colour-customization-per-panel","content":"See Customization for every field."},"298":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-57","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#saving","content":"Bottom button: **Create panel** (new) or **Save changes** (existing). While saving, `Saving...`\nappears next to it. On success you get a `Panel saved` toast and return to the server page. If no\nchannel is chosen, you get `Pick a channel to post the panel in` instead."},"299":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-58","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#saving","content":"Saving **posts or updates the panel message and all its ticket types in Discord**:"},"300":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-59","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#saving","content":"New panel: the message is posted to `Channel to post in`."},"301":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-60","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#saving","content":"Existing panel: the existing message is edited in place. If that fails - for example the message\nwas deleted - the bot re-posts a fresh one."},"302":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-61","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#duplicate-and-delete","content":"On the server page each panel row also has:"},"303":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-62","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#duplicate-and-delete","content":"**Duplicate** - copies the panel and all its types, then opens the copy so you can rename it.\nToast: `Panel duplicated`."},"304":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-63","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#duplicate-and-delete","content":"**Delete** - asks `Delete this panel and its message?`, removes the Discord message, and deletes\nthe panel and its types. Toast: `Panel deleted`."},"305":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/panels-64","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/panels#duplicate-and-delete","content":"You can also manage panels from Discord with `/panel`."},"306":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"page","content":"Server profile","breadcrumbs":["dat one ticketer","Dashboard"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile"},"307":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-0","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile","content":"Give the bot a nickname, avatar, banner and bio for one server."},"308":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-1","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"Fields"},"309":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-2","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#how-images-work","content":"How images work"},"310":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-3","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#what-it-affects","content":"What it affects"},"311":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-4","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"If saving fails"},"312":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-5","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#good-to-know","content":"Good to know"},"313":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-6","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile","content":"The **Bot profile (this server)** card on the server page lets you brand the bot per server. It sits\njust under **General settings**."},"314":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-7","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile","content":"Intro text (exactly as shown):"},"315":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-8","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile","content":"> Give the bot a nickname, avatar, banner and bio just for this server. Avatar and banner take an\n> image URL (or a data URI). Leave a field blank and save to clear it."},"316":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-9","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"| Label      | Meaning                                                     |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Nickname` | The bot's nickname in this server. Up to **32** characters. |","table":"table-0"},"317":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-10","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"| Label              | Meaning                                           |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Avatar image URL` | A server-only avatar. An image URL or a data URI. |","table":"table-0"},"318":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-11","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"| Label              | Meaning                                           |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Banner image URL` | A server-only banner. An image URL or a data URI. |","table":"table-0"},"319":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-12","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"| Label | Meaning                                      |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Bio` | A server-only bio. Up to **190** characters. |","table":"table-0"},"320":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-13","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#fields","content":"Button: **Save profile**. On success you get the toast `Bot profile updated`."},"321":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-14","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#how-images-work","content":"**Avatar** and **Banner** accept either a normal **image URL** (`https://...`) or a **data URI**\n(`data:image/png;base64,...`)."},"322":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-15","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#how-images-work","content":"A URL is fetched by the bot, must return an `image/*` content type, and must be **8 MB or\nsmaller**. Anything else is rejected with an error toast."},"323":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-16","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#how-images-work","content":"These values are remembered per server, so the fields stay filled the next time you open the\npage - clear a field and press **Save profile** to remove the avatar/banner/nickname/bio."},"324":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-17","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#what-it-affects","content":"**Nickname** changes how the bot's name shows in this server only."},"325":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-18","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#what-it-affects","content":"**Avatar** and **Banner** are this server's profile images for the bot."},"326":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-19","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#what-it-affects","content":"**Bio** is the bot's \"about me\" text in this server."},"327":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-20","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#what-it-affects","content":"None of this changes the bot globally, and it doesn't touch panels, tickets or transcripts."},"328":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-21","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"The save is all-or-nothing: if Discord rejects any part, no field is stored."},"329":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-22","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"| Toast                             | Meaning                                                 |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Image must be a URL or data URI` | The value starts with neither `http(s)://` nor `data:`. |","table":"table-1"},"330":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-23","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"| Toast                              | Meaning                             |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `Could not fetch image (<status>)` | The bot could not download the URL. |","table":"table-1"},"331":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-24","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"| Toast                      | Meaning                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `That URL is not an image` | The URL returned a non-image content type. |","table":"table-1"},"332":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-25","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"| Toast                       | Meaning                                    |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `Image is larger than 8 MB` | Shrink the file or host a smaller version. |","table":"table-1"},"333":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-26","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#if-saving-fails","content":"| Toast                               | Meaning                                                                             |\n| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Discord rejected the profile: ...` | Discord refused the result - usually an invalid image or a bio over 190 characters. |","table":"table-1"},"334":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-27","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#good-to-know","content":"Every server can style the bot independently - one server's avatar/nickname never leaks to\nanother."},"335":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-28","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#good-to-know","content":"Changes are recorded in the audit log as `bot.profile`."},"336":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/profile-29","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/profile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/profile#good-to-know","content":"If Discord won't accept an image (wrong format, too large, or a feature the bot's profile can't\nuse), you get an error toast and nothing is saved."},"337":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","type":"page","content":"Settings","breadcrumbs":["dat one ticketer","Dashboard"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/settings"},"338":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings-0","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dashboard/settings","content":"Every field in the General settings card and the server-wide customization card."},"339":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings-1","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/settings#general-settings","content":"General settings"},"340":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings-2","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/settings#naming-scheme-tokens","content":"Naming scheme tokens"},"341":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings-3","page_id":"/docs/dashboard/settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dashboard/settings#language-presets","content":"Language presets"},"342":{"id":"/docs/dashboard/settings-4","page_id":"/docs/da