links."},"529":{"id":"/docs/discord-18","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#permissions-inside-a-ticket","content":"The bot itself can do the above plus manage messages."},"530":{"id":"/docs/discord-19","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#permissions-inside-a-ticket","content":"Your **staff roles** get the same as staff."},"531":{"id":"/docs/discord-20","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#permissions-inside-a-ticket","content":"Your **admin roles** additionally get **Manage Channels**."},"532":{"id":"/docs/discord-21","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#permissions-inside-a-ticket","content":"**Thread tickets** are private threads created under the panel's thread-parent channel (or the\npanel channel). The opener is added as a member; `invitable` is off. Threads auto-archive after\n7 days (10080 minutes) of inactivity."},"533":{"id":"/docs/discord-22","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#permissions-inside-a-ticket","content":"The bot adds the opener to the thread, but **not your staff roles**. A private thread is only\nvisible to its members and to users with **Manage Threads**, so give your staff that permission\nor have them use **Add User** on each ticket. If you would rather not hand out **Manage Threads**,\nuse `Private channel` mode - there your staff roles are granted access directly."},"534":{"id":"/docs/discord-23","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#naming","content":"The channel/thread name is built from the naming scheme (server default, overridden per type).\nSee the naming tokens table."},"535":{"id":"/docs/discord-24","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#pings-on-open","content":"The welcome message pings:"},"536":{"id":"/docs/discord-25","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#pings-on-open","content":"the **opener**, if **Ping the opener** is on; and"},"537":{"id":"/docs/discord-26","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#pings-on-open","content":"the **role IDs to ping** if you set any, otherwise your **staff roles**."},"538":{"id":"/docs/discord-27","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#pings-on-open","content":"This is what actually summons staff to a new ticket. If nobody pings, check\nCustomization → Mention pings."},"539":{"id":"/docs/discord-28","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#limits-and-blacklist","content":"**Blacklisted users** get an ephemeral \"You're not allowed to open tickets in this server\"\nmessage, with the reason if one was set."},"540":{"id":"/docs/discord-29","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#limits-and-blacklist","content":"Regular users are capped by **Max open tickets per user**, and optionally a per-type cap."},"541":{"id":"/docs/discord-30","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#limits-and-blacklist","content":"**Staff** bypass all open-ticket limits (they can always open a ticket to test)."},"542":{"id":"/docs/discord-31","page_id":"/docs/discord","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord#if-something-fails","content":"If the bot can't create the channel (missing permissions, bad category, etc.) the user sees\n`Sorry, I couldn't create your ticket: <reason>`. Fix the permission or channel and try again -\nsee Troubleshooting."},"543":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"page","content":"Panels in Discord","breadcrumbs":["dat one ticketer","In Discord"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels"},"544":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-0","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels","content":"Dropdowns, buttons, sub-types, and the panel message itself."},"545":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-1","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels#panel-types","content":"Panel types"},"546":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-2","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels#sub-types","content":"Sub-types"},"547":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-3","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels#the-panel-embed","content":"The panel embed"},"548":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-4","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels#re-posting-a-panel","content":"Re-posting a panel"},"549":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-5","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/panels#listing-and-deleting","content":"Listing and deleting"},"550":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-6","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels","content":"A panel is a message with a **dropdown** or **buttons**. It is posted by the dashboard (or\n`/panel create`) and edited in place whenever you save the panel. You can also re-post it with\n`/panel resend`."},"551":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-7","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#panel-types","content":"| Style      | UI              | Max types |\n| ---------- | --------------- | --------- |\n| `Dropdown` | One select menu | 25        |","table":"table-0"},"552":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-8","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#panel-types","content":"| Style     | UI                  | Max types |\n| --------- | ------------------- | --------- |\n| `Buttons` | One button per type | 5         |","table":"table-0"},"553":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-9","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#panel-types","content":"Each type can have an **emoji**, a **label** and a **description** (descriptions only appear on\ndropdowns)."},"554":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-10","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#sub-types","content":"If a type lists sub-types, choosing it opens a **second select menu**\n(`Choose a <type> category:`). Options are the sub-types, up to 25. The chosen sub-type becomes the\nticket's subject."},"555":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-11","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#sub-types","content":"To add sub-types, open the type's **Advanced** section in the\npanel editor and use the `Sub-types` field, one per line:"},"556":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-12","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#the-panel-embed","content":"The embed shows your title, description, colour, footer, image and thumbnail, plus an\n**Available options** field listing every type. If you set a **button label / placeholder**, that's\nthe dropdown placeholder (or the button text)."},"557":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-13","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#re-posting-a-panel","content":"If a panel message is deleted, saving the panel edits fail and the bot posts a fresh one. You can\nforce a re-post from Discord:"},"558":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-14","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#re-posting-a-panel","content":"`/panel resend` deletes the old message (if any) and posts a new one in the panel's channel."},"559":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-15","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#listing-and-deleting","content":"`/panel list` shows every panel with its ID, channel and mode."},"560":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-16","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#listing-and-deleting","content":"`/panel delete` removes a panel and its types (and its message)."},"561":{"id":"/docs/discord/panels-17","page_id":"/docs/discord/panels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/panels#listing-and-deleting","content":"See the command reference for the exact arguments."},"562":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"page","content":"Ticket buttons","breadcrumbs":["dat one ticketer","In Discord"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets"},"563":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-0","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets","content":"Claim, add, remove, rename, close, priority, tags and internal notes."},"564":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-1","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#claim","content":"Claim"},"565":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-2","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#add-user--remove-user","content":"Add User / Remove User"},"566":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-3","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#rename","content":"Rename"},"567":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-4","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Close"},"568":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-5","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#priority","content":"Priority"},"569":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-6","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#tags","content":"Tags"},"570":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-7","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/discord/tickets#note","content":"Note"},"571":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-8","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets","content":"The welcome message posted in every ticket has two rows of buttons:"},"572":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-9","page_id":"