ves a thread member."},"579":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-16","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#add-user--remove-user","content":"The action is recorded on the ticket's member list. Staff only."},"580":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-17","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#rename","content":"Opens a modal for a **new channel name**. The name is sanitised (lowercased, non-alphanumerics\nbecome `-`, capped at 90 characters). Staff only."},"581":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-18","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Closes the ticket. **Staff or the ticket opener** can close."},"582":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-19","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Closing does the following:"},"583":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-20","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Marks the ticket `closed` and records who closed it (and when)."},"584":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-21","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Generates the **transcript** and posts it (with the HTML file) to your transcript channel, or the\nlog channel, or nowhere."},"585":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-22","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"DMs the opener a copy if **DM the opener a copy of the transcript** is on."},"586":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-23","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/discord/tickets#close","content":"Archives + locks the thread, **or** deletes the channel if **Delete the channel on close** is on,\notherwise renames it `closed-<number>`."},"587":{"id":"/docs/discord/tickets-24","page_id":"/docs/discord/tickets","tags":[],"type":"