id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#1-simple-support-desk","content":"`Panel style`: `Dropdown`."},"777":{"id":"/docs/recipes-24","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#1-simple-support-desk","content":"Keep the template types (`General Support`, `Bug Report`, `Billing`) or edit them."},"778":{"id":"/docs/recipes-25","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#1-simple-support-desk","content":"**Create panel**."},"779":{"id":"/docs/recipes-26","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#1-simple-support-desk","content":"Users pick a type, get a private channel, and your `Support` role is pinged. Closing deletes the\nchannel and posts the transcript to `#transcripts`."},"780":{"id":"/docs/recipes-27","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"Reports need to be quiet - a panel in a public channel, but tickets only visible to the reporter\nand moderators."},"781":{"id":"/docs/recipes-28","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"**Panel**"},"782":{"id":"/docs/recipes-29","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"**+ New panel** → template `Report a user`."},"783":{"id":"/docs/recipes-30","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"`Channel to post in`: `#report-a-user` (or a read-only info channel)."},"784":{"id":"/docs/recipes-31","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"`Ticket mode`: `Private thread`."},"785":{"id":"/docs/recipes-32","page_id":"/docs/recipes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/recipes#2-moderation-reports","content":"`Thread parent channel (thread mode)`: the channel that should hold the threads (often the panel\nchannel)."},"786":