cess | 3              | Green |"],[61,"| Style  | Discord number | Look |\n| ------ | -------------- | ---- |\n| Danger | 4              | Red  |"],[496,"| Subcommand                 | Does                                           |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `staff-role action: role:` | Add (`add`) or remove (`remove`) a staff role. |"],[505,"| Subcommand          | Does                                |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `add user: reason:` | Blocks a user from opening tickets. |"],[495,"| Subcommand        | Does                                     |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `set key: value:` | Update one setting - see the keys below. |"],[492,"| Subcommand     | Does                   |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `remove user:` | Remove a user (staff). |"],[506,"| Subcommand     | Does             |\n| -------------- | ---------------- |\n| `remove user:` | Unblocks a user. |"],[491,"| Subcommand  | Does                |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `add user:` | Add a user (staff). |"],[480,"| Subcommand | Arguments                                                                                                            | Does                                                                  |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `create`   | `channel` (required), `name` (required), `title`, `description`, `mode` (Channel/Thread), `style` (Dropdown/Buttons) | Creates a panel and posts it. Starts with one `General Support` type. |"],[483,"| Subcommand | Arguments              | Does                                  |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `resend`   | 