en tickets per user** or have them close a ticket. |"],[893,"| Symptom                            | Fix                                                               |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| No servers on the **Servers** page | You need to be the owner or have **Manage Server** on the server. |"],[924,"| Symptom                            | Fix                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Text shows `{something}` literally | That token isn't a valid placeholder. |"],[900,"| Symptom                           | Fix                                                                        |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Image must be a URL or data URI` | Avatar/banner fields accept only `https://...` or `data:image/...` values. |"],[915,"| Symptom                          | Fix                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Staff cannot see a thread ticket | Private threads are only visible to members and users with **Manage Threads**. Grant that permission or **Add User** the staff member - or switch the panel to `Private channel`. |"],[907,"| Symptom                          | Fix                                                                        |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A panel/type value seems ignored | Panels and types override server defaults - check the panel and its types. |"]